            "kind": "note"
          },
          {
            "readme_said": "run `mercury` inside a repository; headless via mercury run",
            "actually_needed": "Interactive `mercury` needs a TTY/repository and `mercury run \"<prompt>\"` needs a signed-in model provider, so neither was runnable with no API keys; verified function with `mercury --help` and `mercury update --check` (no sign-in needed) instead.",
